  "markdown": "## HOUSSEM MEGUEBLI/envelope houssem. meguebli@esprit. tn/phone\n55 562 933/map-marker-alt/linkedin www. linkedin. com/in/houssemmeguebli\nAriana, Tunisia\n\nFULL-STACK DEVELOPER JAVA/ANGULAR/globe https://houssemmeguebli. github. io/github https://github. com/houssemmeguebli\n\n## PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\n\nSUMMARY\n\n## TECHNICAL SKILLS\n\nJava Full-Stack Developer specializing in Spring Boot and Angular, with strong expertise in building scalable RESTful APIs, secure enterprise applications, and database-driven systems. Experienced in containerization, CI/CD workflows, and delivering maintainable, production-ready software solutions.\nSoftware Engineer Intern, SHAMASH IT\nTech: .NET Core, React, Entity Framework, SQL Server\nSummer Intern, SMARTUP\nTech: Spring Boot, Postgre SQL\nDeployed and monitored the application in production on a VPS using Nginx reverse proxy, SSL encryption, and a full observability stack with Prometheus and Grafana.\nTech: Spring Boot, Flutter, My SQL, Redis, Nginx, VPS Deployment, SSL Certificates, Prometheus, Grafana\n\n## PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE\n\nEXPERIENCE\nFreelance Full-Stack Developer\nDesigned and delivered production-ready full-stack applications for real clients.\nDesigned scalable RESTful APIs with secure JWT-based authentication and optimized database access.\n### Tech: Spring Boot, Angular, My SQL, Docker, Git\n**Date:** 2025 - Present, Remote\n\n## ACADEMIC PROJECTS\n\n### End of Studies Project, Telnet Holding\n**Date:** Feb - Jul 2025, Tunis\n### Tech: Flutter, Express. js, SQLite, Python, Serial Communication\n**Date:** Jul - Aug 2024, Tunis\n- PROJECTS\n- Developed cross-platform system to test and monitor BLDC motors for drones with real-time data acquisition.\n- Built platform for managing remote work requests with role-based access control.\n### Jibli - Food Delivery Application [View Project]\n- Co Consult ERP [Git Hub]\n- Developed a secure backend using Spring Security with JWT authentication.\n- Designed scalable backend with Spring Boot and Postgre SQL.\n- Designed and implemented a scalable food delivery system enabling real-time order processing, delivery tracking, and multi-role platform management.\n### Tech: Spring Boot, Angular, My SQL, Spring Security\n- Designed an ERP module for automating recruitment workflows and CV analysis.",
